# budget from 500-adjacent-noalias-scalar-copy.ref: the course solution's count, widened by 10% and rounded up, plus one, and at least three more than the count
instructions <= 26
blocks <= 6
count(call) <= 3
count(load) <= 7
count(store) <= 7
count(phi) <= 3
